# Project Guidelines

Refer directly to [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for canonical instructions:
- Strict typing (`declare(strict_types=1);`), thin controllers, FormRequests, JsonResources.
- SQLite `:memory:` for local dev and tests (`php artisan test`). Never require PostgreSQL locally.
- Keep migrations and queries 100% compatible across SQLite and PostgreSQL.
- Run quality gates: `vendor/bin/pint --dirty --format agent`, `vendor/bin/phpstan analyse --memory-limit=2G`, and `php artisan test`.
